<h1>Best AI Avatar Video Generators 2026</h1>
<p><em>Last updated: November 17, 2026 · Last verified: November 17, 2026 — pricing and credit conversions checked against vendor pricing pages</em></p>

<p>An AI avatar video generator turns a script into a presenter video: you pick an avatar and a background, paste the text, and the avatar speaks it. No camera, no studio, no scheduling a human. The category is now split between platforms built for corporate learning and platforms built for creators and marketers, and the split shows up in how they bill.</p>

<p>Every tool below publishes credits rather than minutes, so this guide converts credits into finished minutes using each vendor's own conversion. That single step is what separates a $19 plan that covers 12 minutes from a $29 plan that covers 30 — and prevents the most common mistake in this category, which is subscribing to a plan whose credits run out in two videos.</p>

