<h2>1. Synthesia — Best for Training and Faceless Channels</h2>
<p>Synthesia is the most mature platform in the category and the one that behaves like enterprise software: SOC 2 Type II, ISO 27001, ISO 27701 and ISO 42001 certifications, EU data residency, SSO, and SCORM export so a video can be dropped straight into an LMS. The creator-relevant parts are the avatar library, 140+ languages with lip-synced translation, and the fact that re-recording means editing the script rather than reshooting.</p>
<p>The credit maths is published: a typical finished minute costs about 100 credits. Basic is free with roughly 10 minutes a month and a watermark; Starter is $19/month for 1,250 credits (about 12 minutes, 125+ avatars, watermark removed); Pro is $89/month for 6,000 credits (about 60 minutes) plus five personal avatars. Personal avatars start at Pro — Starter does not include them.</p>

