<h2>2. HeyGen — Best for Creator and Marketing Video</h2>
<p>HeyGen targets the creator and marketing side of the market: fast avatar generation, 175+ languages and dialects, voice cloning, and a free tier loose enough to produce a genuine sample — three videos a month up to one minute each, watermarked, with one custom video avatar included.</p>
<p>Creator is $29/month ($24/month billed annually) for 600 credits, 30-minute videos and watermark-free 1080p export. Pro starts at $49/month with more credits and 4K, and Business is $149/month plus $20 per additional seat. The credit burn rate depends on the avatar model: the newest high-realism avatars consume roughly 20 credits per minute, which puts Creator at about 30 minutes a month — cheaper per finished minute than Synthesia, but with a shorter video cap on the entry tier.</p>

