<p>There is no free plan — a 14-day trial with 300 credits (about 10 minutes) — then Starter at $25/month billed annually ($29 monthly) for 24,000 credits, Professional at $35/month annual ($59 monthly) for 72,000 credits, and Teams at $119/month annual. Annual plans grant all credits upfront, which is unusual and useful if your production is seasonal.</p>

